# The 14th letter of the [[Serbo-Croatian Cyrillic alphabet]].

====Usage notes====
The name of the letter is {{m|sh|ље|tr=lje}}. It represents a [[palatal]] [[lateral]] consonant like Italian ''gl'' in {{m|it|figlio}}. The Latin-alphabet equivalent is {{m|sh|lj}} (upper case {{m|sh|Lj}}).

